      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Developing GNOME applications using gtkmm&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;gtkmm is the official C++ interface for the popular GUI library GTK+. It is designed to ensure typesafe programming and yet let programmers enjoy&#xA;the neat model of the Gtk+ framework.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will present Gtkmm and the so called modern programming techniques associated to the C++ language that are available to GNOME application programmers today.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It will focus on techniques to write safer GNOME applications and libraries in a modular manner.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
